{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"ae3860a1dc6cbabb8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Audit R13 调研 agent `ab56e030d7ec24cad` 关于 CPMpy 0.10.0 MUS API 的 claim。这是 follow-up source-verify audit，11/11 历史救火率说明 agent 即使引用 URL 也常错。\n\n## 项目背景\n\n终末地工业规划器路线图 P2 #18 \"MUS via CPMpy QuickXplain\"。R13 agent 把工时从 4d 砍到 1-2d，理由是 CPMpy 0.10.0 MUS API 稳定 + OR-Tools 9.15 已对齐。这条 verdict 直接影响下一步 PoC 选择。\n\n## R13 agent 的关键 claim（需要 audit）\n\n读 transcript 文件：`/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/ab56e030d7ec24cad.output`\n\n(1) **CPMpy 0.10.0 release 2026-01-19**\n(2) **R5 调研时是 0.9.24 (2025-01)，半年内 6 个 patch (0.9.25-0.9.29) + 1 minor 全部落地**\n(3) **`cpmpy.tools.explain` 提供 mus()/quickxplain()/marco()/ocus()，需要 solver 支持 assumptions（ortools/exact/z3/pysat 都支持）**\n(4) **v0.10.0 加了 RC2 MaxSAT backend、pindakaas CNF 编码、Bool×Int linearisation、OR-Tools 9.15 兼容修复**\n(5) **`from cpmpy.tools.explain import quickxplain` 一行可用**\n(6) **cvc5 1.3.4 release 2026-05-07, Python binding pip install cvc5==1.3.3**\n(7) **Z3 4.16.0 release 2026-02-19**\n(8) **SMT-COMP 2025 QF_LIA: OpenSMT 1, cvc5 2, Yices2 3, Z3-alpha 4**\n(9) **SMT-COMP 2025 QF_BV: Bitwuzla-MachBV/Bitwuzla 1-2, Yices2 3, cvc5 4**\n\n## Audit 任务\n\n1. **CPMpy PyPI**: WebFetch `https://pypi.org/project/cpmpy/`\n   - 当前版本 + 0.10.0 release 日期是否对得上 2026-01-19\n\n2. **CPMpy GitHub releases**: WebFetch `https://github.com/CPMpy/cpmpy/releases`\n   - 0.9.24 → 0.10.0 之间的 patch 列表\n\n3. **CPMpy tools.explain API**: WebFetch CPMpy docs\n   - `https://cpmpy.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/tools/explain.html` 或类似\n   - 是否真有 quickxplain/mus/marco/ocus\n\n4. **cvc5/Z3 PyPI**:\n   - `https://pypi.org/project/cvc5/` 看版本\n   - `https://pypi.org/project/z3-solver/` 看 Z3 4.16.0\n\n5. **SMT-COMP 2025**:\n   - WebFetch `https://smt-comp.github.io/2025/` 看主页\n   - WebFetch `https://smt-comp.github.io/2025/results/qf_lia-single-query/` 看 QF_LIA 排名\n   - 名次：OpenSMT/cvc5/Yices2/Z3 是否对得上 transcript 数字\n\n每条 claim 标 CONFIRMED / PARTIALLY / REFUTED。\n\n## 输出格式（不超过 600 字，中文）\n\n```\n## 9 条 claim audit 结果\n| # | claim | verdict | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | CPMpy 0.10.0 release 2026-01-19 | ... | URL |\n| ... | | | |\n\n## 关键修正\n[列错的部分]\n\n## 路线图修订建议\n- P2 #18 工时 1-2d claim: 仍有效 / 需要修订到 X\n- \"立即可做\" verdict: 维持 / 改\n\n## verdict\nCONFIRMED / PARTIALLY / REFUTED\n```\n\n## 操作准则\n\n- 必须 WebFetch 实际 PyPI / GitHub / SMT-COMP 页面\n- transcript 引用的 URL 也要重新 fetch\n- 简洁\n\n开始。"},"uuid":"33c4866a-8806-43cc-84ab-f68b3e7f92f6","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:50:18.375Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
