{"parentUuid":"df8f8320-169c-4164-8a52-75e149e924af","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"ae3860a1dc6cbabb8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RdXEUcapR3dy8hiWuLAgXJ","type":"tool_result","content":"# SMT-COMP 2025 Results\n\nBased on the provided content, I cannot answer your specific questions about the main results, divisions, or winning solvers in various tracks.\n\nThe webpage indicates that **\"Results are available!\"** as of August 11, 2025, with a link to the results page. However, the actual results data—including which divisions exist, winning solvers for QF_LIA, QF_BV, and QF_LRA tracks, and top placements—are not included in the content provided to me.\n\nTo find this information, you would need to visit the full [Results page](/2025/results/) referenced on the website."}]},"uuid":"60a99e53-0201-4bc5-b023-b63d7082c1f6","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:50:59.256Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"df8f8320-169c-4164-8a52-75e149e924af","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"f51fa777-a1ec-4202-98a0-26cd6be88dbc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"ae3860a1dc6cbabb8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019aZsMEETnGP2nd7G9XDUcN","type":"tool_result","content":"# CPMpy Explanation Tools API Summary\n\n## Public API Exports\n\nBased on the documentation, **cpmpy.tools.explain** exports the following main modules:\n\n- **mus** - Minimal Unsatisfiable Subset algorithms\n- **mss** - Maximal Satisfiable Subset algorithms\n- **mcs** - Minimal Correction Subset algorithms\n- **marco** - MUS/MCS enumeration\n- **utils** - Utility functions\n\n## Key Functions Available\n\nThe following functions are documented as part of the public interface:\n\n1. **quickxplain()** - \"Find a preferred minimal unsatisfiable subset of constraints, based on the ordering of constraints\"\n2. **mus()** - Core deletion-based MUS algorithm\n3. **marco()** - \"Enumerating minimal unsatisfiable subsets (MUSes) and minimal correction sets (MCSes)\"\n4. **ocus()** - Optimal constrained MUS computation\n\n## Solver Backend Requirements\n\nThe documentation specifies that these explanation tools require solvers supporting **assumptions and unsat core extraction**:\n\n- **ortools** (default)\n- **exact**\n- **z3**\n- **pysat**\n\nThe documentation notes that \"for solvers that support `s.solve(assumptions=…)` and `s.get_core()`\" the assumption-based implementations work optimally. Naive variants are provided for solvers without assumption support, though they may be significantly slower."}]},"uuid":"1cde5377-8a0a-4da8-83e6-1ccfa4dd5417","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:00.900Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f51fa777-a1ec-4202-98a0-26cd6be88dbc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ec4feca1-b308-40b9-94a0-c9992b9d1fed","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"ae3860a1dc6cbabb8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V3Fcd9LgBDJ9DRpUYZoayN","type":"tool_result","content":"# Top 5 Ranked Solvers for QF_LIA Single-Query Track (SMT-COMP 2025)\n\nBased on the Sequential Performance rankings:\n\n1. **OpenSMT** - 4,579 correct solutions\n2. **cvc5** - 4,443 correct solutions\n3. **Yices2** - 4,395 correct solutions\n4. **Z3-alpha** - 4,204 correct solutions\n5. **SMTInterpol** - 4,203 correct solutions\n\nOpenSMT dominated across multiple performance metrics, winning in sequential performance, parallel performance, SAT performance, and UNSAT performance categories. The competition evaluated solvers against \"4825 benchmarks\" with a 1200-second time limit."}]},"uuid":"6410a569-9d23-443c-ab6f-49cf093da7f9","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:01.517Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ec4feca1-b308-40b9-94a0-c9992b9d1fed","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
