{"parentUuid":"a9178b80-8640-4512-b002-4ba6ff6b77f0","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"ae3860a1dc6cbabb8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Pmdjsy2XRYoAZAtARFvySU","type":"tool_result","content":"# Top 5 Solvers - QF_BV Single Query Track (SMT-COMP 2025)\n\nBased on sequential performance scoring, the highest-ranked solvers are:\n\n1. **Bitwuzla-MachBV** - 10,523 problems solved with a correct score of 10,523 (base +38)\n\n2. **Bitwuzla** - 10,498 problems solved with a correct score of 10,498\n\n3. **Yices2** - 10,491 problems solved with a correct score of 10,491\n\n4. **cvc5** - 9,938 problems solved with a correct score of 9,938\n\n5. **z3siri** - 9,308 problems solved with a correct score of 9,308 (base +364)\n\nBitwuzla-MachBV achieved the best performance across all winner categories, including sequential, parallel, and SAT performance tracks."}]},"uuid":"dcf7e36a-cdba-4d1c-8721-2cbab43c569a","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:10.243Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a9178b80-8640-4512-b002-4ba6ff6b77f0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"dcf7e36a-cdba-4d1c-8721-2cbab43c569a","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ae3860a1dc6cbabb8","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01G98AJ3JZyEvUCxYXbE6QQn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All claims verified. Now let me write the audit report.\n\n## 9 条 claim audit 结果\n\n| # | claim | verdict | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | CPMpy 0.10.0 release 2026-01-19 | CONFIRMED | PyPI 实测：0.10.0 = Jan 19, 2026 |\n| 2 | R5 时 0.9.24 (2025-01)，半年内 0.9.25-0.9.29 + 1 minor | CONFIRMED | PyPI 时间线：0.9.24 (2025-01-17) → 0.9.25 (2025-05-07) → 0.9.26 (2025-08-10) → 0.9.27 (2025-10-06) → 0.9.28 (2025-10-17) → 0.9.29 (2026-01-15) → 0.10.0 (2026-01-19)。共 5 patch + 1 minor，跟 R5 调研日期 2026-05-08 也对得上 |\n| 3 | `cpmpy.tools.explain` 提供 mus/quickxplain/marco/ocus，需要 assumption 支持 (ortools/exact/z3/pysat) | CONFIRMED | readthedocs 实测，全部 4 个函数公开导出；4 个 backend 名单完全一致 |\n| 4 | v0.10.0 加 RC2 MaxSAT、pindakaas CNF、Bool×Int linearisation、OR-Tools 9.15 兼容 | CONFIRMED | GitHub release notes 4 项全对得上；额外有 Hexaly callback、文档增强 |\n| 5 | `from cpmpy.tools.explain import quickxplain` 一行可用 | CONFIRMED | API 公开导出，签名匹配 |\n| 6 | cvc5 1.3.4 release 2026-05-07，pip cvc5==1.3.3 | PARTIALLY | PyPI 实测：1.3.4 = May 7 2026（CONFIRMED），1.3.3 = Feb 25 2026。**transcript 写\"pip install cvc5==1.3.3\" 在 2026-05-08 调研日已过时**（1.3.4 前一天就出来了）。建议 pin 1.3.4 |\n| 7 | Z3 4.16.0 release 2026-02-19 | CONFIRMED | PyPI z3-solver 实测 4.16.0.0 = Feb 19, 2026 |\n| 8 | SMT-COMP 2025 QF_LIA: OpenSMT 1, cvc5 2, Yices2 3, Z3-alpha 4 | CONFIRMED | smt-comp.github.io 实测排名 1-4 完全一致（OpenSMT 4579, cvc5 4443, Yices2 4395, Z3-alpha 4204） |\n| 9 | SMT-COMP 2025 QF_BV: Bitwuzla-MachBV/Bitwuzla 1-2, Yices2 3, cvc5 4 | CONFIRMED | 实测 1=Bitwuzla-MachBV(10523), 2=Bitwuzla(10498), 3=Yices2(10491), 4=cvc5(9938)。完全对 |\n\n## 关键修正\n\n- **claim #6 cvc5 pin 版本过时**：transcript 建议 `pip install cvc5==1.3.3`，但实测 1.3.4 已于 2026-05-07（调研前 1 天）发布。如果 R13 调研触达 PyPI 应该看到 1.3.4，没看到说明检索时刻有偏差。建议项目改 pin `cvc5==1.3.4`（patch release，无 breaking）\n- 其他 8 条全 CONFIRMED，**11/11 救火率统计在本次审计中被打破**：9 条只挑出 1 条 PARTIALLY（且仅是版本号过时一周）\n- WebFetch 在 GitHub releases 页面把 2026 年误报为 2024，但 PyPI 给的日期与 transcript / 同 WebFetch session 内一致，以 PyPI 为准\n\n## 路线图修订建议\n\n- **P2 #18 (MUS via CPMpy QuickXplain) 工时 1-2d claim：维持有效**\n  - 9 条 claim 的核心 4 条（CPMpy 0.10.0 实存 + tools.explain API 完整 + assumption-based MUS 算法稳定 + OR-Tools 9.15 兼容已修复）全 CONFIRMED\n  - \"立即可做\" verdict 维持\n  - 落地命令：`pip install cpmpy>=0.10.0`，import 路径 `from cpmpy.tools.explain import mus, quickxplain, marco, ocus`\n- **P3 cvc5 binding 替换**：相关数据点（cvc5 1.3.4 + SMT-COMP 排名）也对，PoC 启动前 pin `cvc5==1.3.4` 而非 transcript 建议的 1.3.3\n- 后续如果 P2 #18 引入 SMT 路径做 audit 通道，QF_LIA SOTA 是 OpenSMT 而非 cvc5——但 OpenSMT 没有维护良好的 Python binding，cvc5 仍是 Python 工程化最佳折中（这点 transcript 没明说，建议补到路线图笔记）\n\n## verdict\n\n**CONFIRMED**（9/9，仅 1 条 PARTIALLY 是版本号在调研后 1 天升 patch，不影响 P2 #18 工时与可行性 verdict）"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":33899,"output_tokens":1898,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":466},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1898,"cache_read_input_tokens":33899,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":466,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CastjFKHfjA52vQbPD9tY","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"cffbdcfd-302a-4bbe-a790-a08e53002f39","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:44.046Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
